OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry and fine day to
OL,6,Fcome with some good spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine. An outside chance of the odd
OL,8,Fshower developing by the afternoon,
OL,9,Fbut most avoiding them. Feeling
OL,10,Fpleasantly warm in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining fine and dry this
OL,13,Fevening. Cloud will increase overnight
OL,14,Fwith rain reaching the west by dawn. A
OL,15,Fmild night for most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
