OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRain quickly spreading
OL,6,Facross the region, leading to a rather
OL,7,Fcloudy and wet day. Some drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter spells may develop at times,
OL,9,Fbut further rain arriving by the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,13,Fand brighter on Thursday, before rain
OL,14,Farrives overnight. Rain may linger
OL,15,Finto Friday, before turning drier and
OL,16,Fbrighter again on Saturday. Feeling
OL,17,Fwarm in any brighter moments.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
